# Continue -> release handoff

When using `/continue`, do not loop forever once the batch is coherent.

Hand off to `/release` when:

- the dirty set belongs to one workstream
- docs are updated for that work
- local verification is good enough for the repo's current tooling
- no higher-value local implementation step remains
